          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.162,
            0.883,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "On the usual 12-hour clock, there are timings with different patterns. For example, 4:44, 10:10, 12:21."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.212,
            0.877,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Try and find out all possible times on a 12-hour clock of each of these types."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.264,
            0.569,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Manish has his birthday on 20/12/2012 where the digits ‘2’, ‘0’, ‘1’, and ‘2’ repeat in that order."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.343,
            0.569,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find some other dates of this form from the past."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.394,
            0.571,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "His sister, Meghana, has her birthday on 11/02/2011 where the"
