          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.473,
            0.723,
            0.496
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find all possible dates of this form from the past."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.503,
            0.884,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Jeevan was looking at this year’s calendar. He started wondering, “Why should we change the calendar every year? Can we not reuse a calendar?”. What do you think?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.571,
            0.885,
            0.639
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You might have noticed that last year’s calendar was different from this year’s. Also, next year’s calendar will also be different from the previous years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.644,
            0.819,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But, will any year’s calendar repeat again after some years? Will all dates and days in a year match exactly with that of another year?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.834,
            0.642,
            0.933,
            0.707
          ],
          "content": [
